,"events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yzxcj797/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yzxcj797/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-22T13:28:58Z","updated_at":"2026-08-22T13:28:58Z","body":"The garnix failures on the last two pushes (gotest, golangci-lint, and everything downstream) are not from this change — the go-modules derivation dies downloading dependencies inside the sandbox:\n\n```\ngo: ... github.com/klauspost/compress@v1.18.6: reading https://proxy.golang.org/github.com/klauspost/compress/@v/v1.18.6.zip: 403 Forbidden\ngo: ... modernc.org/sqlite@v1.52.0: reading https://proxy.golang.org/modernc.org/sqlite/@v/v1.52.0.zip: 403 Forbidden\nerror: build of '/nix/store/...-go-modules.drv' on 'ssh-ng://nix-ssh@gigabuilder' failed\n```\n\nproxy.golang.org is 403ing the builder for uncached modules (same signature on #3430, which also touches the module set, while PRs whose go-modules derivation is already cached stay green). This branch does not touch go.mod/go.sum.\n\nLocal verification: `go build ./...` clean, `CGO_ENABLED=0 go test -skip TestPostgres` over the garnix test set passes (the only local failures are `TestConfigLoading`/`TestConfigFileLoading`, which need Windows symlink privileges and are unrelated).","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/comments/5380661136/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"yzxcj797","id":54314860,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0MzE0ODYw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/54314860?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yzxcj797","html_url":"https://github.com/yzxcj797","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yzxcj797/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yzxcj797/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yzxcj797/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yzxcj797/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yzxcj797/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yzxcj797/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yzxcj797/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yzxcj797/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yzxcj797/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/comments/5422863414","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/3433#issuecomment-5422863414","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/3433","id":5422863414,"node_id":"IC_kwDOEFLz888AAAABQzpUNg","user":{"login":"kradalby","id":98431,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk4NDMx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/98431?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby","html_url":"https://github.com/kradalby","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-26T08:48:19Z","updated_at":"2026-08-26T08:48:19Z","body":"Garnix failure has been fixed if you rebase of main.\r\n\r\nThis _sounds_ reasonable, but we need to validate what behaviour the Tailscale SaaS has for this kind of scenario. Would you be willing to validate that?","author_association":"COLLABORATOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/comments/5422863414/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"kradalby","id":98431,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk4NDMx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/98431?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby","html_url":"https://github.com/kradalby","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"id":30031335698,"node_id":"MIE_lADOEFLz888AAAABNyVzZs8AAAAG_gHREg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/events/30031335698","actor":{"login":"kradalby","id":98431,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk4NDMx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/98431?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby","html_url":"https://github.com/kradalby","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/starr